      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Totally agreed.\n\nThis could reduce duplicate storage, repeated uploads, and repeated downloads. \n\nLater, this could become a creator-economy opportunity: creators could publish free or paid asset libraries, and others could obtain permission or purchase licenses to use them as world dependencies.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
